          "description": "A large number of bends across a single progressive strip risks cumulative dimensional drift and spring-back stack-up, especially given non-uniform detected wall/gauge readings.",
          "impact": "Out-of-tolerance flatness/angle leads to scrap or added restrike stations, raising unit cost 10-20%.",
          "fix": "Simulate bend sequence in die-design software; add a restrike/calibration station; hold consistent gauge across the blank."
